[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
stalwart-migrate must match the Stalwart v1 server that will open the
migrated store:

- Without the ENTERPRISE option (the default, as in mail/stalwart),
  the tool writes a store that only a Stalwart server built without
  the enterprise feature can open.
- The official Stalwart binaries, with or without an Enterprise
  license, need a stalwart-migrate built with the ENTERPRISE option.

The source must run Stalwart v0.16.27; upgrade earlier 0.16 releases
first. The tool only supports the backends selected when it was built.
FoundationDB is not supported by this port.

The manual is the upstream README.md (installed in
%%DOCSDIR%% with the DOCS option) and
https://github.com/stalwartlabs/stalwart-migrate
EOM
}
]
